# --- Live ORB voice session verification (acoustic) -- deliberately NOT
# attempted, on governance grounds discovered while writing this VTID:
# this session's OWN prior work (VTID-03716, scripts/tts/
# verify-cascade-audio-timing.ts header comment) already establishes that
